{"id":"77d1d8d811a70e18","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-cat-initial-object.md","title":"ZFC Cat Initial Object","display":"df-zfc-cat-initial-object — ZFC Cat Initial Object","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-initial-object","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-initial-object"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-initial-object — ZFC Cat Initial Object","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-initial-object"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-initial-object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-initial-object — ZFC Cat Initial Object"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(i,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatInitialObject}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatInitialObject}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}initial\\text{-}object} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatInitialObject}_S(i,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\exists O,A,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C=\\langle O,A,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land i\\in O\\land \\forall X\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in A\\;(s(f)=i\\land t(f)=X)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}initial\\text{-}object} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatInitialObject}_S(i,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\exists O,A,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C=\\langle O,A,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land i\\in O\\land \\forall X\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in A\\;(s(f)=i\\land t(f)=X)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Initiality is expressed by a unique morphism to every object; the former homomorphism dependencies did not supply the category predicate actually used.</li>\n<li>The object and arrow carriers and the source and target maps are unpacked from the six-component category datum, so no ambient accessor remains free.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"i,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatInitialObject}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}initial\\text{-}object} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatInitialObject}_S(i,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\exists O,A,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C=\\langle O,A,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land i\\in O\\land \\forall X\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in A\\;(s(f)=i\\land t(f)=X)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1167,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1562","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-cat-initial-object.md|58-df-zfc-cat-initial-object]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}